@startuml
title Agent Resolve — Approved Version Preconditions, Atomic Update
actor Agent
participant "Angular Agent Detail" as UI
participant "AgentDisputeController" as C
participant "DisputeService" as S
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
Agent -> UI : Accept or Reject + internal notes + customer message
UI -> C : POST /agent/disputes/{id}/resolve + If-Match
C -> S : Resolve authenticated agent request
S -> DB : Load dispute + version
alt Malformed precondition
  S --> C : Error 1004 (400)
else Missing/stale precondition
  S --> C : Error 2007 / 2006 (428 / 412)
else Not assigned or invalid status
  S --> C : Error 2005 (409)
else Valid assigned agent + UNDER_REVIEW
  group One database transaction
    S -> DB : Resolve with version/state/assignee guard; retain agent + assigned_at
    alt Guarded write succeeded
      S -> DB : Append resolution event with resulting disputeVersion
      S -> DB : Commit
      S --> C : 200 agent detail + new strong ETag
    else Lost guarded write race
      S -> DB : Rollback; no event committed
      S --> C : Error 2006 (412)
    end
  end
end
C --> UI : HTTP status + JSON envelope + X-Correlation-ID
UI --> Agent : Confirmation / refresh-on-conflict
note over UI, DB
Strong ETag/If-Match is approved for all agent mutations.
Terminal assignment and assigned_at retained; customer identity redacted.
Acceptance records a decision only.
No payment reversal or refund is initiated.
end note
@enduml
